The [[Lightsaber]] is a godly [[Weapon]] available in the shop for all classes. It deals moderate damage, increased by {{icon/blind}} on the opponent, and can spend {{icon/regeneration}} to inflict temporary {{icon/blind}}.

Other than the [[Adventurer]]-exclusive [[Scissorswords]], the [[Lightsaber]] is the biggest source of {{icon/blind}} scaling in the game, although there are very few actual sources of {{icon/blind}} to get this number up, with the only simple-to-acquire, permanent source being [[Pocket Sand]]. The damage can become fairly respectable as long as the {{icon/regeneration}} use ability is activated routinely, but there is a somewhat low practical limit to the amount of supplementary {{icon/blind}} that can be inflicted by all items.

Consider upgrading the [[Lightsaber]] to the [[Darksaber]] using a [[Corrupted Crystal]]. The [[Darksaber]] deals more base damage, inflicts permanent {{icon/blind}} using {{icon/mana}}, and scales off of all debuffs, although it scales worse off of {{icon/blind}} in particular. In general, the other debuffs are much easier to accumulate in high quantity, drastically raising the damage ceiling of the [[Darksaber]] compared to the [[Lightsaber]]. 
